# Employee Management CLI

A simple Employee Management System built using **Python CLI**.

## Features

* Add Employee
* Update Employee
* Delete Employee
* Search Employee
* List Employees
* Highest Salary
* Average Salary
* Department Filter

## Technologies

* Python
* Lists & Dictionaries
* Functions
* Loops
* Conditional Statements

## Programming Practice

15 Python problems were also practiced, including:

1. Reverse String
2. Palindrome
3. Largest Number
4. Second Largest
5. Remove Duplicates
6. Missing Number
7. Duplicate Number
8. Character Frequency
9. Non-Repeating Character
10. Merge Arrays
11. Common Elements
12. Stack
13. Queue
14. Maximum Subarray
15. Sorting


